  <fileFormat>1</fileFormat>
  <!-- A compilation of stellar models using the Limongi & Chieffi (2018) massive star yields in place of those
       of Portinari, Chiosi & Bressan (1998).

       Limongi & Chieffi (2018) extend down to Z = 3.2e-5, roughly a factor of twelve below the metallicity floor
       of Portinari, Chiosi & Bressan (1998), but cover initial masses of 13 Msun and above only. They are
       therefore combined here with the Marigo (2001) asymptotic giant branch models, and with the Portinari,
       Chiosi & Bressan (1998) *lifetimes*, which are needed below 13 Msun. The Portinari, Chiosi & Bressan
       (1998) yields are deliberately NOT included: they cover 9-120 Msun and would overlap the Limongi &
       Chieffi models, leaving the interpolation to blend two mutually inconsistent sets of stellar models over
       the same region of the (mass, metallicity) plane.

       The massive star file included here is explosion set M (mixing and fallback) for non-rotating models.
       Limongi & Chieffi report four explosion sets which differ only in which stars explode, and three initial
       rotation velocities; set M and set R bracket the explodability uncertainty, since in set R everything
       above 25 Msun collapses entirely to a black hole so that only the wind is ejected. Swap the include below
       for one of the other stellarPropertiesLimongiChieffi2018_set<F|I|M|R>_v<000|150|300>.xml files to explore
       those variations.

       Note that no yields are available between the 5 Msun upper limit of Marigo (2001) and the 13 Msun lower
       limit of Limongi & Chieffi (2018); yields in that range are interpolated across the gap. -->
  <xi:include href="stellarPropertiesMarigo2001.xml"                          xpointer="xpointer(stars/star)" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"/>
  <xi:include href="stellarPropertiesHegerWoosley2002.xml"                    xpointer="xpointer(stars/star)" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"/>
  <xi:include href="stellarPropertiesTumlinsonShullVenkatesan2003.xml"        xpointer="xpointer(stars/star)" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"/>
  <xi:include href="stellarPropertiesPortinariChiosiBressan1998Lifetimes.xml" xpointer="xpointer(stars/star)" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"/>
  <xi:include href="stellarPropertiesLimongiChieffi2018_setM_v000.xml"        xpointer="xpointer(stars/star)" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"/>
</stars>
